@startuml A05-class-design
!pragma layout smetana
title A05 输入、角色、移动与相机类图（已确认）
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam classBackgroundColor #EFF6FF
skinparam classBorderColor #2563EB
skinparam ArrowColor #475569
hide empty members
top to bottom direction

class UExperimentPlayerConfig <<UDataAsset>> {
 InputActions / MappingContexts
 Gait / Camera / DodgeParams
}
class AExperimentPlayerController <<APlayerController>> {
 - InputContext / ControlEpoch
 - PendingIntents
 + SetupInputComponent()
 + UpdateCameraManager(dt)
 + InvalidateInput()
}
class AExperimentCharacter <<ACharacter>> {
 - BindingKey / Root: weak
 + RequestDodge(Context)
 + ResetForRun(Binding, Config)
}
class USphericalCharacterMovementComponent <<A07 已确认 / UCharacterMovementComponent>> {
 - 唯一速度 / 接地 / CurrentGait
 + 径向重力 / 胶囊扫掠 / 姿态
}
class UExperimentMovementComponent <<玩家派生类>> {
 - DodgeRuntime / ExecutionKey
 + TryCommitDodge(Decision, Context)
 + PhysCustom(dt, Iterations)
 + CaptureDodgeProtection(Occurrence)
}
class AExperimentPlayerCameraManager <<APlayerCameraManager>> {
 - ViewMode / ViewModeRevision / ViewSerial
 + ProcessViewRotation(...)
 + UpdateCamera(dt)
 + GetFinalAimFrame()
}
class FPlayerDataMapper <<UE C++ / 无状态>> {
 {static} ToDodgeSnapshot(...)
 {static} ToExecutionParams(Decision)
}
class "experiment::DodgeRules" as Rules <<标准 C++20 / 无状态>> {
 {static} Evaluate(Snapshot, Params)
}
class AExperimentWorldDirector <<既有 / 世界装配>>
class UExperimentSubsystem <<既有 / Session 宿主>>
class USphericalMinimapComponent <<A04 已确认>>
class "胶囊 / 双 Camera / SpringArm" as Parts <<UE 现有组件>>
class "A06/A07 只读状态与战斗入口" as Combat <<后续类型边界>>

AExperimentWorldDirector --> AExperimentCharacter : 单一绑定 / 复位入口
UExperimentSubsystem --> AExperimentPlayerController : 受限阶段 / 运行通知
AExperimentPlayerController --> UExperimentPlayerConfig : 强引用 / 只读
AExperimentCharacter --> UExperimentPlayerConfig : 强引用 / 只读
AExperimentPlayerController --> AExperimentCharacter : 控制 / 合法意图
AExperimentPlayerController --> AExperimentPlayerCameraManager : 引擎管理 / 最终视图
AExperimentPlayerController *-- USphericalMinimapComponent
AExperimentCharacter *-- UExperimentMovementComponent : 唯一移动组件
USphericalCharacterMovementComponent <|-- UExperimentMovementComponent
AExperimentCharacter *-- Parts
AExperimentPlayerCameraManager --> AExperimentCharacter : 驱动单一活动视角
AExperimentCharacter ..> FPlayerDataMapper : 查询结果转纯值
AExperimentCharacter ..> Rules : 纯值求值
AExperimentCharacter ..> Combat : 只读硬直 / 完整来袭
AExperimentPlayerController ..> Combat : 最终 AimFrame + 攻击意图
Combat ..> UExperimentMovementComponent : 受击时查询保护结果

note bottom of UExperimentMovementComponent
位移结束不等于窗口到期。
输入 ControlEpoch 不进入已接纳动作标识。
无敌窗口唯一归属 Movement，A06 只读采样。
end note
@enduml
